    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"walking away from the ashes\"... i don't know if i even have the strength to walk. it just seems so much easier to just... stop. to not have to feel the weight of everything breaking anymore. is it really so wrong to just want to find some peace before the fire gets to me?",
